"Moving around the disk ring is one movement now. Going back up more than one level used to change the screen without animating at all, the ring travels for longer the further it goes, and the slight overshoot at the end of each move — which read as a snap — is gone." = "ディスクリングの移動が一つの動きになりました。2 階層以上戻るときはアニメーションがなく、画面が切り替わるだけでした。";
